# Webapp Page & Component Rules

## Routing (App Router)

```
webapp/src/app/
├── page.tsx               # /
├── sign-in/page.tsx       # /sign-in
├── sign-up/page.tsx       # /sign-up
├── profile/page.tsx       # /profile
├── presets/page.tsx       # /presets
├── admin/presets/page.tsx # /admin/presets
├── admin/contact/page.tsx # /admin/contact
└── api/backend/[...path]/route.ts  # backend proxy
```

Shared components → `webapp/src/components/`
Utilities → `webapp/src/lib/`
Types → `webapp/src/types/`

## Page Template

```tsx
import { Metadata } from 'next';

export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: 'Feature — Digital Vision Board',
  description: 'Brief SEO description.',
};

export default function MyFeaturePage() {
  return (
    <main className="min-h-screen bg-[#F6F4EF]">
      {/* content */}
    </main>
  );
}
```

Every page must export `metadata`.

## Server vs Client Components

- **Default to Server Components** — no `'use client'`
- Add `'use client'` only when using hooks, event listeners, or browser APIs
- Fetch data in Server Components; pass down as props

## Authentication

```tsx
// Server component — check session
import { getSession } from '@/lib/session';
import { redirect } from 'next/navigation';

const session = await getSession();
if (!session) redirect('/sign-in');
```

Admin pages must additionally verify admin status:
```tsx
if (!session?.isAdmin) redirect('/');
```

## Backend API Calls

Use `@/lib/backend` helpers — never raw `fetch` against the backend:
```tsx
import { backendGet, backendPost } from '@/lib/backend';

const data = await backendGet('/api/endpoint', session.token);
await backendPost('/api/endpoint', payload, session.token);
```

## Tailwind — Morning Garden Colours

| Purpose | Class |
|---|---|
| Page background | `bg-[#F6F4EF]` |
| Primary button bg | `bg-[#4A7A5A]` |
| Primary button text | `text-white` |
| Nav / header bg | `bg-[#3B2D20]` |
| Coin icon colour | `text-[#C48B3C]` |
| Amber reward **text** | `text-[#7A5520]` |
| Card surface | `bg-white dark:bg-[#1F2B22]` |
| Mood / journal | `text-[#7B74A8]` |
| Chip / tag bg | `bg-[#DCF0E4]` |
| Badge container | `bg-[#FDF3E3]` |

**Never use** `text-[#C48B3C]` for text — it fails WCAG AA. Use `text-[#7A5520]`.

## Border Radii

```
rounded-3xl  → 24px (cards)
rounded-xl   → 12px (inputs, buttons)
rounded-lg   → 8px  (chips)
```

## Font

Inter is loaded globally in `layout.tsx`. Use `font-sans` — do not import or load fonts again.

## TypeScript

- No `any` unless absolutely unavoidable (document why with a comment)
- Define prop interfaces explicitly
- Use path alias `@/` for all imports from `src/`

## SEO

Every page exports `metadata`. Use `@/lib/seo` helpers for consistent OG tags:
```tsx
import { buildMetadata } from '@/lib/seo';
export const metadata = buildMetadata({ title: '...', description: '...' });
```
